<p>Lay a pressure triggered trap that explodes in a radius 2 cloud of searing flames when triggered, stunning foes with the blast (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">41, 48, 54, 59, 63</acronym> fire damage per turn) for 3 turns.</p><p>The deflagration persists in the area for 5 turns, burning foes for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">61, 73, 81, 89, 95</acronym> fire damage each turn.</p><p>This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.</p>